 \see A. Montresor, Algoritmi e Strutture Dati, 2025, chapters 5 and 6,
      https://algoritmicamente.it/materiali/libro/capitoli/cap05.pdf and
      https://algoritmicamente.it/materiali/libro/capitoli/cap06.pdf
 \see D. E. Knuth, The Art of Computer Programming, vol. 1, 3rd ed.,
      Addison-Wesley, 1997, sections 2.3.1 (the traversal of binary trees,
      the threads) and 2.3.2 (the binary representation of trees)
 \see A. V. Aho, J. E. Hopcroft, J. D. Ullman, Data Structures and
      Algorithms, Addison-Wesley, 1983, chapter 3 (the representations of
      trees)
 \see A. J. Perlis, C. Thornton, Symbol manipulation by threaded lists,
      Communications of the ACM 3(4), 195-204, 1960,
      doi:10.1145/367177.367202
 \see J. Vuillemin, A unifying look at data structures, Communications of
      the ACM 23(4), 229-239, 1980, doi:10.1145/358841.358852
